   Buildings/3rd International Conference on Built Environment and Public
   Health, Guilin, PEOPLES R CHINA, MAY 29-31, 2009},
Organization = {Hunan Univ; Univ Hong Kong; Tsinghua Univ},
Abstract = {Outdoor wind environment quality (OWEQ) is very important on both the
   outdoor thermal comfort and the indoor natural ventilation. In this
   paper, the design factors of enclosed residential quarter were concluded
   basing on 23 cases in Guangzhou, and the wind environment of these
   quarters were simulated by CFD software. The evaluation indexes were
   introduced according to the simulation results. Generally, the OWEQ of
   enclosed residential quarter was better when air flowed more smoothly
   inside. OWEQ would be obviously different only when the evaluation
   indexes changed quite large caused by different urban planning
   proposals. The conclusion and indexes of this paper should be helpful to
   the urban planners; however, the common and accurate evaluation index
   system need more work.},
