   Coll; German Acad Exchange Serv Fdn; German Embassy China},
Abstract = {In this paper, the authors study the sustainable development of costal
   Chinese cities from the perspective of ecological environment and
   tourism economy. An urban tourism economy and coordinated model is
   established. The model contributes to make a quantitative assessment for
   sustainable development of coastal Chinese cities. Taking Rizhao as an
   example, the authors calculate the sustainable development degree of
   tourism and environment of the city. The results show that Rizhao is
   good in terms of regional sustainable development. However, the local
   ecological environment should be improved.},
