   Geophys; Chinese Acad Sci; Engn Technol Press},
Abstract = {Evaluation of urban human settlements is a key part of the science of
   human settlements. Based on the principle of environmental friendliness,
   evaluation index system of urban human settlement has been established
   so as to supply city for reference in harmonious development and
   better-living construction. The model of Fuzzy Matter-element can be
   used in evaluating the good or bad of urban human settlements. Taking 30
   provincial capital cities as an example, the result shows that it is
   fairly consistent in regard to habitual perceptual cognitions. So the
   evaluation of urban human settlements will also be helpful to determine
   function and direction of a city.},
