Organization = {China Assoc Sci \& Technol},
Abstract = {Located in the headstream of the Yangtze River, the Yellow River and the
   Lancang River, three rivers source nature reservation is the ecological
   barrier for regional sustainable development of midstream and downstream
   of the three rivers. Meanwhile, the economy of this area is still very
   backward. The living standards of the people are still in the poor
   state. Thus, it is very urgent to protect and develop three rivers
   source area and to improve the development level of culture and economy.
   This paper summarizes the protection real state of the reservation, and
   explains the predominant conditions of sustainable development, for
   example resources of animal and plant, tourism resources, mineral
   resources and water resources. Whereas there are many problems in
   regional protection and sustainable development at present, nature
   factors, human activities such as overgrazing, out-of-order exploiting
   the gold, excavating the Chinese caterpillar fungus, smuggling wild
   animals which destroyed the ecological environment and resources. There
   exists some restrict factors in the area such as faulty policy,
   undeveloped traffic and people of low diathesis, etc. We propose some
   suitable local development strategies on the principle of obtaining best
   economic benefit, social benefit and ecological benefits according to
   the actual conditions, develop the eco-tourism,-set up some
   characteristic and pollution-free industries such as processing and
   producing peculiarly green agricultural product of the area, livestock
   produce and locally special products. Through guarantee of policy,
   adjust of law and regulation, propagation and education and staff
   training guarantee sustainable development and utilization of natural
   and humane resources of three rivers source nature reservation.},
