   15-17, 2008},
Abstract = {Based on RS and GIS, the 2003a's aerial image data of Shanghai is taken
   as data source and the urban landscape database has been constructed
   with the open source object-relationship database platform PostgreSQL.
   In this ORDBMS, the urban landscape can be well classified into nine
   types, including industrial landscape, inhabited landscape, green
   landscape, etc. At last, the impact of urban expansion on its interior
   landscape structure are revealed microcosmic using the extensible SQL in
   PostgreSQL ORDBMS. And several landscape ecology indexes have been
   calculated. The interactive urban landscapes analyzing system based on
   PostgreSQL can provide powerful spatial analysis abilities for
   governments to make urban planning decisions and landscape study.},
