   methods to measure facial expression are briefly summarized. What has
   been learned about emotion from this work on the face is then
   elucidated. Four questions about facial expression and emotion are
   discussed: What information does an expression typically convey? Can
   there be emotion without facial expression? Can there be a facial
   expression of emotion without emotion? How do individuals differ in
   their facial expressions of emotion?},
