   Bassi, Marta, Univ Milan, Dept Biomed \& Clin Sci L Sacco, Via GB Grassi 74, I-20157 Milan, Italy.
   Falautano, Monica; Minacapelli, Eleonora, Hosp San Raffaele, Dept Neurol, I-20132 Milan, Italy.
   Cilia, Sabina, Univ Polyclin Hosp G Rodol, Multiple Sclerosis Ctr, Catania, Italy.
   Goretti, Benedetta; Amato, Maria Pia, Univ Florence, Sect Neurosci, Dept NEUROFARBA, Florence, Italy.
