Abstract = {Based on the investigation and analysis of the effectiveness of RWH
   projects, the development of studies and practices about urban rainwater
   harvest (RWH) and runoff pollution control (RPC) in Beijing was
   reviewed. The typical technical process, storage volume calculation
   methods, first flush regular and control facilities were described in
   this article. The characteristics of urban runoff pollution and its
   proportion for the water environment in Beijing were analyzed. The
