Abstract = {This article focuses on cross subjects' emotions classification from
   electroencephalogram signals (EEG). We propose a hierarchical classifier
   based on Long Short Term Memory (LSTM) neural networks for this task.
   For model training and testing, we use the signals from SEED database.
   Cross subjects emotions classification into neutral, positive and
   negative achieved an accuracy of 80\% when using the proposed method.},
