   15-17, 2008},
Abstract = {The action of perception of human begins with the feeling and
   perception, and it is the base of activities of psychology and action of
   people. Now most of model of perception is descriptive. Of the small
   number of computable model, early research is concentrated on perceptive
   production rule, but this model doesn't consider the uncertainty of
   events and situation. So the computable model is set up, and the means
   of diagnosis trouble is adopted to observe surrounding, compute the
   result of perception, and achieve the credibility of perception. The
   attributes of directive apperceive can be obtained by a controller of
   direction and modulation. Attributes of perception of other main bodies
   and previous attributes can be united by means of combination of proof.
   Based on this, using game of table tennis as an example, the model is
   tested. Changing some parameters, the model can apply in many kinds of
   sport games.},
