Abstract = {Low-carbon city is a hotspot under the background of climate change.
   Current problem on low-carbon urban planning was analyzed based on
   low-carbon city development practices. Low-carbon urban planning methods
   were studied from an ecosystem perspective, and new pathways for
   low-carbon city construction were suggested. Low-carbon development
   should be carried on from four aspects: urban structure, urban function,
   urban energy flow and urban material flow. The integrity and character
   of low-carbon city should be highlighted. Meanwhile, low-carbon city
   should be sustainable with a rapid urban economic development and
   increasing carbon emission reduction.},
