   Kingdom Int Grp},
Abstract = {An air quality analysis was conducted to characterize and quantify
   mobile source air emissions associated with ten transportation scenarios
   for Yosemite National Park in support of the Yosemite Valley
   Implementation Plan Supplemental Environmental Impact Statement. These
   transportation strategies are aimed at reducing traffic congestion in
   Yosemite Valley by eliminating day-use visitor vehicles from the east
   end of the Valley and providing shuttle bus transportation from staging
   areas within and outside the Park. Air emissions were estimated to he
   reduced under all scenarios.},
