Abstract = {To investigate whether the thermal environment has impact on
   hemorheology characteristics of living creature, feed the experimental
   specimen that is twelve Guinea pigs in the ventilation installation for
   ten days. The air's temperature, relative humidity and ventilation mode
   in the ventilation installation can be controlled. Sample the blood from
   the hearts of Guinea pigs and then test the hemorheology characteristics
   of it. Do significance analysito the data. The result shows that thermal
   environment has impact on hemorheology characteristics of living
   creature. This consequence established a basis for an indoor air quality
   (IAQ) evaluation method at hemorheology characteristics aspect.},
